WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Calm. Simulated scenario.

00:02.000 --> 00:05.000
Alert. A simulated target appears.

00:05.000 --> 00:12.000
Danger. Three simulated threats move across the radar.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.000
The sweep highlights a target; rings and trails fade.

00:15.000 --> 00:17.000
Return to the alert state.

00:17.000 --> 00:18.000
Calm. End of demonstration.
